{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dive into a puzzle game inspired by timeless hits like <i>Zuma</i>. Pop vibrant bullets, chain dazzling combos, and ascend to conquer the skies. Strategize your moves, master dynamic challenges, and prove you have what it takes to claim ultimate victory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><br>Gameplay Highlights</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fire colorful bullets, match them against ever-changing backgrounds, and create jaw-dropping combos. Test your reflexes and wits to survive and rise to earn fame and glory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><br>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Epic Combos:</strong> Master the art of precision to unleash spectacular chain reactions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Endless Mode:</strong> Push your skills to the limit\u2014only the best can endure.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Vivid Themes:</strong> Immerse yourself in a world of vibrant colors and captivating designs.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Prepare yourself for a puzzle adventure that\u2019s as rewarding as it is addictive!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Tiny bomber","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3361030/a37a4a798b44f346bd60f023963ace105bc3ddbf.jpg"},{"name":"Baby\u2019s First Bomb","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3361030/20a740e08899422297db1ed85c1180d89bf9776a.jpg"},{"name":"Blast Enthusiast","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3361030/ae6464a27c44644db514647b5e2d24a5b31fe264.jpg"},{"name":"Unstoppable Bomber","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3361030/4111bcd2309f13bd3c51cc717305b67ca8c1fca1.jpg"},{"name":"Demolition Hobbyist","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3361030/